# Cell matrix for parallel multi-model runs.
# Format: name | wave | backend | model | port
#
# name      = unique cell identifier
# wave      = execution wave number (1-N, cells in same wave run in parallel)
# backend   = "claude" or "opencode" (agent subprocess backend)
# model     = model ID for opencode backend (empty string for claude default)
# port      = backend dev port for this cell (must be unique across all cells)
#
# To use a custom matrix: CELLS_CONF=./my-cells.conf bash run-parallel.sh --from-baseline
#
deepseek-v4-pro-cake1 | 1 | opencode | opencode-go/deepseek-v4-pro | 3201
qwen3.6-plus-cake1 | 1 | opencode | opencode-go/qwen3.6-plus | 3301
# claude-opus-cake1 | 2 | claude | | 3101
# claude-opus-cake2 | 2 | claude | | 3102
deepseek-v4-pro-cake2 | 3 | opencode | opencode-go/deepseek-v4-pro | 3202
qwen3.6-plus-cake2 | 3 | opencode | opencode-go/qwen3.6-plus | 3302
